TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_BSBE_PlayingFromBehindII_Escape_B=Nous agrandissons nos mines spatiales automatisées.

TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_BSBE_PlayingFromBehindII_Escape_C=À grande échelle
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_BSBE_PlayingFromBehindII_Escape_C=Nous agrandissons nos avant-postes automatisés.


